elements.requirements:
The user documentation shall state
* that the product does not have the capability to appropriately protect personal data and/or is not intended to handle personal data;
* that the user shall ensure that data collected by the solution is handled in compliance with data protection regulations (e.g. GDPR, DSGVO).

